Package: jellyscratchserver
Version: 1.0.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sam <sam@local>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, python3-requests, curl, ca-certificates, jellyfin
Description: JellyScratch Server - Standalone Jellyfin Media Server & Discord Live Monitor
 All-in-one desktop application for Jellyfin Media Server with an embedded
 native player window, auto-starting server, and a Discord Webhook monitor
 that posts and live-updates (every 30 seconds) active movie playback stats.
